019dbbbb-50a4-77cb-3cad-86141ed508e4	Good Morning off Pins	push	intermediate	compound	barbell	{hamstrings}	{abdominals,glutes,"lower back"}	{"Begin with a bar on a rack at about the same height as your stomach. Bend over underneath the bar and rack the bar across the rear of your shoulders as you would a power squat, not on top of your shoulders. At the proper height, you should be near parallel to the floor when bent over. Keep your back tight, shoulder blades pinched together, and your knees slightly bent. Keep your back arched and your cervical spine in proper alignment.","Begin the motion by extending through the hips with your glutes and hamstrings, and you are standing with the weight. Slowly lower the weight back to the pins returning to the starting position."}	{Good_Morning_off_Pins/0.jpg,Good_Morning_off_Pins/1.jpg}	powerlifting	[0.006228972,0.01905579,0.0075176456,-0.045360863,-0.006101202,-0.0048343292,0.007889119,-0.0012841568,0.0028993033,0.0005758311,-0.023982601,-0.011714486,-0.015758697,-0.020494817,0.12367372,0.005951761,0.025476675,0.024995942,-0.006673217,-0.02552865,0.0152882775,-0.0067940294,0.004224351,0.005671206,0.009221629,-0.0106452545,-0.0033653902,0.014839647,0.07314072,0.020872282,-0.023829896,-0.009901012,0.02078202,0.013156261,0.0032012977,0.022511082,0.02268351,-0.03675275,0.004631178,0.0029139093,-0.020198839,0.012435626,-0.0013224044,0.0038052285,-0.014815054,0.010835219,-0.0077135693,0.024930326,0.008214467,0.016932836,0.012353348,0.00031114148,-0.028788976,-0.18966745,-0.007627582,-0.0012467637,0.011833322,-0.014598756,0.01162668,-0.005894869,0.008520954,0.01004286,0.018108329,-0.014000823,-0.021546075,-0.025149377,0.016220346,-0.018007964,-0.0074674604,0.0011295221,0.025569053,-0.0023147454,0.0025573212,0.005780533,-0.023999518,-0.028731886,0.014733292,0.018977966,-0.004452224,0.003266363,0.005015318,0.011580616,-0.01104543,0.0105152475,-0.02783382,-0.023543661,-0.015580118,0.008182184,0.033584405,0.0060614008,0.005004473,-0.023