019dbbbb-50a5-7d9a-d10d-4e762e5f59db	Hanging Leg Raise	pull	expert	isolation	body only	{abdominals}	{}	{"Hang from a chin-up bar with both arms extended at arms length in top of you using either a wide grip or a medium grip. The legs should be straight down with the pelvis rolled slightly backwards. This will be your starting position.","Raise your legs until the torso makes a 90-degree angle with the legs. Exhale as you perform this movement and hold the contraction for a second or so.","Go back slowly to the starting position as you breathe in.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."}	{Hanging_Leg_Raise/0.jpg,Hanging_Leg_Raise/1.jpg}	strength	[0.004885169,0.018373853,0.013128536,-0.033259228,0.008624444,0.0072497544,0.039541453,0.0023317323,-0.014043113,-0.010297825,-0.0153579535,0.014032338,-0.010439776,0.0030701293,0.1336187,0.0011059921,0.025280207,0.0011095699,-0.022641068,-0.037177727,-0.0005528775,0.004950479,0.008785764,-0.006414833,0.0035699366,-0.00081119605,0.01971627,-0.0056105456,0.029098904,0.0038045563,-0.0027031712,-0.0049741613,0.025258712,-0.0067237234,-0.009026864,0.027058477,0.020865,-0.013936209,0.025599241,0.027961807,-0.012819365,0.024521058,-0.008496495,0.0021131265,-0.0041980008,-0.01177623,-0.004482167,0.012918561,0.023777809,0.012600359,-0.017530074,0.015341693,-0.01603973,-0.19204748,-0.0023626066,0.0068896096,-0.0006893742,-0.01647529,0.013256319,-0.0013567045,-0.00035694212,-0.0038903705,0.015637929,0.008545146,-0.045343768,-0.02470679,-0.010489874,-0.005079456,-0.026034081,-0.0042512855,0.014776513,-0.008654283,0.030454842,0.016633444,0.01048723,-0.015912369,-0.0035324737,0.004192357,0.035347275,-0.015081969,-0.0075115827,-0.008655194,-0.014527565,-0.008690213,0.0065109525,0.0014988064,-0.013045135,0.015701966,-0.001066017,-0.0012250617,-0.0025161316,0.0025309725,0.024613779,-0.0023477222,-0.012781008,-0.006073954,-0.014004217,-0.012113681,-0.055653535,0.00034612566,-0.022294607,-0.026035452,-0.004572078,0.0005764787,0.00