019dbbbb-50ae-752e-ff3f-4f5faaee6f7e	Suspended Push-Up	push	beginner	compound	other	{chest}	{shoulders,triceps}	{"Anchor your suspension straps securely to the top of a rack or other object.","Leaning into the straps, take a handle in each hand and move into a push-up plank position. You should be as close to parallel to the ground as you can manage with your arms fully extended, maintaining good posture.","Maintaining a straight, rigid torso, descend slowly by allowing the elbows to flex.","Continue until your elbows break 90 degrees, pausing before you extend to return to the starting position."}	{Suspended_Push-Up/0.jpg,Suspended_Push-Up/1.jpg}	strength	[0.0116918115,0.009221026,-0.0065307147,-0.044276834,0.0020399352,-0.0015331693,0.025682021,0.003134995,-0.013481102,-0.007787485,-0.010607264,0.018683989,0.004169105,0.001531033,0.11248578,-0.028176129,0.0073878653,0.013234868,-0.0033275231,-0.015870247,-0.005542675,-0.024088174,0.004925793,-0.013278868,0.0040363306,-0.019664805,0.03116705,-0.012604579,0.04080052,-0.0014204604,-0.006261224,-0.020114684,0.037946448,0.010803707,-0.015552464,-0.0069950097,0.008753893,-0.023603136,-0.0032829407,0.014766974,-0.022471113,0.016958928,0.0044737994,0.013471187,-0.01704823,0.0087045245,-0.0053988975,-0.0024584162,0.012451094,0.03567638,-0.0023946317,0.00063501974,-0.010102719,-0.19099176,-0.0011568182,0.024354933,0.0143908765,-0.021075487,0.0026806837,0.025076,-0.014721576,0.022232229,0.0025049914,0.0002812031,-0.037674796,-0.020475596,0.016573928,-0.0024012474,-0.026239375,0.009233584,0.0093136905,0.0067159715,0.011908134,0.009038975,-0.0020334192,-0.014570734,0.014699942,0.0061459863,0.03458334,-0.00946756,-0.0027104614,-0.030969916,-0.010575254,-0.018974364,-0.011370027,-0.00607544,-0.011807017,0.03331794,-0.0104384385,0.004518353,0.0023683037,-0.0017490381,0.027236095,-0.02029694,-0.025113652,-0.018153409,0.0012493541,0.0035509337,-0.035206027,-0.029955361,-0.021396808,-0.013723519,0.0062248213,-0.03330142,-0.006474930