019dbbbb-50af-70aa-f37a-f26a43fbdc68	Two-Arm Dumbbell Preacher Curl	pull	beginner	isolation	dumbbell	{biceps}	{}	{"Grab a dumbbell with each arm and place the upper arms on top of the preacher bench or the incline bench. The dumbbell should be held at shoulder length. This will be your starting position.","As you breathe in, slowly lower the dumbbells until your upper arm is extended and the biceps is fully stretched.","As you exhale, use the biceps to curl the weights up until your biceps is fully contracted and the dumbbells are at shoulder height.","Squeeze the biceps hard for a second at the contracted position and repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."}	{Two-Arm_Dumbbell_Preacher_Curl/0.jpg,Two-Arm_Dumbbell_Preacher_Curl/1.jpg}	strength	[0.009678675,0.026588656,-0.021883091,-0.04174892,-0.008108035,0.009247195,0.011111139,0.011674225,-0.02310053,0.010131675,-0.01289632,-0.020762395,0.0020648125,-0.016180636,0.121807635,-0.016965322,0.037940133,-0.014869511,-0.011768464,-0.03461076,-0.017987534,-0.006628551,0.00022920333,-0.022460788,-0.009043769,-0.016200505,0.017813517,0.0015746404,0.06830242,0.0010476679,-0.004869694,-0.020960797,-0.0004813764,0.0021001592,0.012117209,0.018813824,0.008789787,-0.007880882,-0.008648022,0.026550092,-0.0032939021,0.01592666,-0.018950574,0.02220405,-0.013866198,-0.010471709,0.013101194,0.016374804,0.0071203695,0.029219719,-0.02965973,0.0038621037,-0.022422545,-0.1846879,0.002775704,0.015153776,0.008489826,0.004710432,0.00031129527,0.002905966,0.0013205019,0.016460344,-0.020157807,-0.018291513,-0.0074306666,0.0016489184,-0.015070711,-0.034460254,-0.020547947,-0.02528906,0.008235627,-0.0010786953,0.030494403,0.00741553,0.012982394,-0.03710182,-0.0013779717,-0.012481264,0.0061328164,-0.010868751,-0.023934634,0.0053157574,-0.023068104,0.0013446813,-0.02460286,-0.02243478,-0.0018798407,0.023767374,-0.017692013,-0.0008555918,-0.013105979,-0.0018897651,0.027876722,-0.010580747,0.009639289,0.016643519,0.017689403,-0.008768324,